          <p>User profiles, orgs, roles, permissions, and invitations — all through a beautiful dashboard.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature">
          <div class="ficon"><svg class="" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 16.98h-5.99c-1.1 0-1.95.94-2.48 1.9A4 4 0 0 1 2 17c.01-.7.2-1.4.57-2"/><path d="m6 17 3.13-5.78c.53-.97.1-2.18-.5-3.1a4 4 0 1 1 6.89-4.06"/><path d="m12 6 3.13 5.73C15.66 12.7 16.9 13 18 13a4 4 0 0 1 0 8"/></svg></div>
