          <p>React to sign-ups, sign-ins, MFA events, and role changes with signed, retryable webhooks.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature">
          <div class="ficon"><svg class="" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 2l-9.6 9.6"/><circle cx="7.5" cy="15.5" r="5.5"/><path d="m21 2-2 2"/><path d="m18 5 3 3"/></svg></div>
