  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="eyebrow">Workflow</div>
        <h2>Integrate in 4 steps</h2>
      </div>
      
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step"><div class="num">01 —</div><h4>Create a project</h4><p>Sign up and grab your API keys from the dashboard.</p></div>
        <div class="step"><div class="num">02 —</div><h4>Install the SDK</h4><p>One line of code in Node, Python, Go, or React.</p></div>
        <div class="step"><div class="num">03 —</div><h4>Drop in the widget</h4><p>Pre-built, themable login and sign-up UI.</p></div>
        <div class="step"><div class="num">04 —</div><h4>Ship & monitor</h4><p>Watch sign-ins, MFA challenges, and webhooks live.</p></div>
      </div>
